  "description": {
    "en": "Grapplesnake Alpha is the softer and more powerful sister string to Tour Sniper. Designed as a premium pentagonal tour polyester, it combines excellent directional control with increased comfort, feel and ball speed. Its stable response under heavy impact makes it ideal for advanced players seeking tournament-level precision without the harshness of traditional control polyester strings.",

    "zh": "Grapplesnake Alpha 是 Tour Sniper 的姊妹线，在保持 Tour 级控制能力的同时，进一步提升了舒适性、力量和击球手感。它采用五边形共聚酯结构，击球反馈稳定，甜区表现优秀，即使面对大力量击球也能保持精准控制，非常适合希望拥有竞技级表现但又不喜欢传统聚酯过硬手感的球员。"
  },

